(91781,'Welcome to Harborage, outsider, my name is Sanv\'Kla, the leader of this place.\n\nI guide my people to a better fate away from the hellish landscape we once called home.\n\nPerhaps this is home now, and for the better.\n\nThe Draenei here are friendly and will treat you with respect.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
