(92002,'It is a surprise to see a new face around here. We were shipwrecked quite a while ago, and have made an alright living here.\n\nThis is Caelan\'s Rest, named after the Admiral who led our fleet and died when we were attacked. If you\'re here to help, we certainly need it.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
