(92010,'The Marines usually get all the credit, but we do all of the hard work.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92011,'Do you know who you\'re speaking to? I am THE Valdarion Smite! Yeah, that\'s the one!\n\nI am a world-renowned boxer, the champion of Kul Tiras in fact! I haven\'t been home in about four years now, but I held the title when I was last there!\n\nSuch a shame to be drafted like this, huh. Especially a shame to be stuck here..\n\nOh well, the lads and lasses here are good enough to me, especially with my fame back home.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92012,'I hope my men have treated you well, we have become somewhat ragged since our departure from Stormwind.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92013,'Fresh blood huh? You looking to make a name for yourself out here? Become something of a hero like all those tales say?\n\nWell, sorry to tell you, but all you\'re gonna find out here is stinky swamp water.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92014,'You heard anything from Stormwind? The bastards have left us high and dry out here.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
