(92017,'Hello, and welcome to Sorrowguard, I am Paladin Janathos, and I keep vigil over this place\n\nThis Stronghold was built before the first war as a means to watch the entrance westward into the Kingdom of Azeroth.\n\nIt has fallen into a state of disrepair since its fall during the first war.\n\nAfter its destruction I was sent here to attempt to reclaim it. While we have done some repairs and occupied the place, there is always more that can be done. Especially with the darkness of the swamps beside us, and the orcs lurking at Stonard.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92021,'I keep all the boots here in good order, you looking for a pair?',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92022,'I\'m not allowed inside anymore, but they let me keep my shack!\n\nLooking to buy some mushrooms?',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92024,'I have fought in many wars, and have slain many foes. All the way from Draenor, to this outpost here, and I will lead it with great honor.\n\nI am entrusted by the greatest minds in Orgrimmar to lead the Horde\'s efforts, and I shall...\n\nHave you come to lend a hand, to make a name for yourself?',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92025,'Oh, to be in Boralus again… I can\'t wait to head home once the ship is all repaired. I\'m going to go to every pub, every day, for at least a year.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92132,'I am bound to my duty.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92133,'The world has changed a lot, and it seems so very different from when I left it.\n\nSomething lingers within the air, but I cannot see it, there is something amiss, but my thoughts are muddled, and almost lost to themselves.\n\nI can see you though, you are in a place that I once called home, that many of my people called home, lost to the ages of time.\n\nI don\'t know why I am here again, but you will aid me.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92137,'Please, don\'t kill me!\n\nI\'m the bootlegger who created the recipe for the famous Southsea Reserve!\n\nYou... you can buy some of it if you\'d like!',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92168,'Welcome to Kalkor Point, I assume you have many questions about why there are Centaur here in Giljim.\n\nA long time ago, practically six years now, we set sail from Kalimdor and joined up with the Southsea Pirates. We were hired as mercenaries, and fighters, but our leader betrayed us, and kept the gold for himself.\n\nHe has gained the name of \'Reaver\' for his brutality and his lack of care or compassion for his fellow brothers in arms. The name Kalkor Point comes from the name of our Mercenary Band, and we wear it like an award.\n\nOne day we hope to return home to our kin, but that day still seems far off.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92171,'It takes a brave heart to continue on after tragedy, and keep a good face to the world.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(92174,'Lykourgos will pay for what he has done.',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
