(6258002,'What\'s your opinion on the jousting tournament?','What\'s your opinion on the jousting tournament?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6258003,'Why is it forbidden for you to leave the keep?','Why is it forbidden for you to leave the keep?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6258004,'<The young noble exhales a frustrated sigh.>$B$BWell hello, fair peasant. Curious that the guards let you inside Amberwood Keep, given Northwind\'s current... let\'s say ‘precarious\' situation. Did you slide them some coin or are you just that charismatic? Alas, here you are, so you might as well entertain me. Auntie Josephine doesn\'t even let me out on the castle walls and I am getting bored to death reading the same old tomes again and again.','<The young noble exhales a frustrated sigh.>$B$BWell hello, fair peasant. Curious that the guards let you inside Amberwood Keep, given Northwind\'s current... let\'s say ‘precarious\' situation. Did you slide them some coin or are you just that charismatic? Alas, here you are, so you might as well entertain me. Auntie Josephine doesn\'t even let me out on the castle walls and I am getting bored to death reading the same old tomes again and again.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6258005,'Eh, thank you? You probably shouldn\'t say that to any other Northwind noble, adventurer. Atleast if you value your freedom. To be frank with you, I actually reside in Stormwind most of my time, it just occurred that I was visiting my aunt when all of the chaos around here happened, so I cannot leave until the other noble\'s get a firm grip on their lands again. I don\'t know if you met Duke Sherwood or Sir Amberwood at the Jousting Grounds yet, but they\'re probably more of what you expect Stormwind nobility to be. Eccentric personality, all the aloofness that comes with their rank, a harsh and strict disposition. If you want to rule over the common folk, it\'s hard not to develop these traits. Luckily my aunt is more of the benevolent type, unless you anger her. I will pray for your safety should you ever accomplish that.','Eh, thank you? You probably shouldn\'t say that to any other Northwind noble, adventurer. Atleast if you value your freedom. To be frank with you, I actually reside in Stormwind most of my time, it just occurred that I was visiting my aunt when all of the chaos around here happened, so I cannot leave until the other noble\'s get a firm grip on their lands again. I don\'t know if you met Duke Sherwood or Sir Amberwood at the Jousting Grounds yet, but they\'re probably more of what you expect Stormwind nobility to be. Eccentric personality, all the aloofness that comes with their rank, a harsh and strict disposition. If you want to rule over the common folk, it\'s hard not to develop these traits. Luckily my aunt is more of the benevolent type, unless you anger her. I will pray for your safety should you ever accomplish that.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6258301,'If you wish to join us on our operation on Balor, my steadfast gryphon Steelwing can bring you there.','If you wish to join us on our operation on Balor, my steadfast gryphon Steelwing can bring you there.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6258601,'One day, my shoulders will bear heavier burdens. But today, I am simply a child of the Horde — here to fight on its behalf.','One day, my shoulders will bear heavier burdens. But today, I am simply a child of the Horde — here to fight on its behalf.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6258701,'The Shadow Council. The Stormreaver Clan. The puppets of Gul\'dan—a fate I once shared. Do not mistake me for one of your Forsaken allies, nor for a mere misguided warlock. I hold dominion over the deepest, coldest corners of the Twisting Nether.','The Shadow Council. The Stormreaver Clan. The puppets of Gul\'dan—a fate I once shared. Do not mistake me for one of your Forsaken allies, nor for a mere misguided warlock. I hold dominion over the deepest, coldest corners of the Twisting Nether.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6258801,'I do not feel the gaze of the Earthmother upon this island. The weather here is ever grim, with no sight of An\'she, Mu\'sha, or even Lo\'sho. Foul magic is at play, and it must be met with fury. The winds guided me here at first for something as simple as mere proof of good faith from our matron.$B$BYet, the longer I am lost to the warm touch of An\'she, the more rage fills my very being. I hold neither love nor hatred for you or our current allies, child of the Horde. But I will not stand for this. These fel-ridden fleas must no longer deny this haunted place its sun.','I do not feel the gaze of the Earthmother upon this island. The weather here is ever grim, with no sight of An\'she, Mu\'sha, or even Lo\'sho. Foul magic is at play, and it must be met with fury. The winds guided me here at first for something as simple as mere proof of good faith from our matron.$B$BYet, the longer I am lost to the warm touch of An\'she, the more rage fills my very being. I hold neither love nor hatred for you or our current allies, child of the Horde. But I will not stand for this. These fel-ridden fleas must no longer deny this haunted place its sun.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6258901,'Listen. With the pouring rain comes the loud crash of the skies. It feels as if a magnificent being wields a grand whip, striking the clouds back into submission so that their torment may never end—and the rain may never cease.','Listen. With the pouring rain comes the loud crash of the skies. It feels as if a magnificent being wields a grand whip, striking the clouds back into submission so that their torment may never end—and the rain may never cease.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6259001,'A question aches at the back of my mind: Has this world truly forgotten me? All that I was—lost, by choice or fate.$B$BWherever I turn my gaze, I see nothing. Nothing. This New Horde, our people\'s future, abandoned me. But I will not abandon it.$B$BMany sang my death to bury the past. Yet here I stand, ready to end what remains of Gul\'dan\'s misery. I feel duty, but also jealousy. What sets me apart from Grommash Hellscream? Were his final acts so grand that they erased his past?$B$BI recall when his name was sung as hero, while I was dismissed as an elder. Perhaps it is unbecoming of me to feel this way, but I will not fade. My name will stand among legends—not by death, but by atonement.$B$BThe Shadow Council will face the wrath of my clan, my ancestors, and MY MIGHT.$B$BLok-tar ogar!$B$BFor the Horde!','A question aches at the back of my mind: Has this world truly forgotten me? All that I was—lost, by choice or fate.$B$BWherever I turn my gaze, I see nothing. Nothing. This New Horde, our people\'s future, abandoned me. But I will not abandon it.$B$BMany sang my death to bury the past. Yet here I stand, ready to end what remains of Gul\'dan\'s misery. I feel duty, but also jealousy. What sets me apart from Grommash Hellscream? Were his final acts so grand that they erased his past?$B$BI recall when his name was sung as hero, while I was dismissed as an elder. Perhaps it is unbecoming of me to feel this way, but I will not fade. My name will stand among legends—not by death, but by atonement.$B$BThe Shadow Council will face the wrath of my clan, my ancestors, and MY MIGHT.$B$BLok-tar ogar!$B$BFor the Horde!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6262001,'Step right in, poor sod; after one bite of our patented ‘Sausaged Cheese Bread\', you\'ll be wanting nothing else for the rest of your life!','Step right in, poor sod; after one bite of our patented ‘Sausaged Cheese Bread\', you\'ll be wanting nothing else for the rest of your life!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6262101,'Cherox and I came up with the most innovative culinary masterpiece Azeroth has ever witnessed! Never before has there been such a combination of flavour and texture, it will knock you right out of your boots, making you come crawling back for more!','Cherox and I came up with the most innovative culinary masterpiece Azeroth has ever witnessed! Never before has there been such a combination of flavour and texture, it will knock you right out of your boots, making you come crawling back for more!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
