(6270601,'Can I interest you in the newest attraction among dedicated collectors, my friend? Pet rocks are the latest shazam all across Azeroth and you, good $c, are right at the source! My one-of-a-kind, limited pet rocks will bring you good fortune, an impressive love life and the strength to easily best any adversary foolish enough to cross your path! Whaddaya say, have I got your attention?','Can I interest you in the newest attraction among dedicated collectors, my friend? Pet rocks are the latest shazam all across Azeroth and you, good $c, are right at the source! My one-of-a-kind, limited pet rocks will bring you good fortune, an impressive love life and the strength to easily best any adversary foolish enough to cross your path! Whaddaya say, have I got your attention?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6271001,'I had fled the darkness before. Out of shame. Out of guilt. Out of disgust. My old self revelled in the depravity of Gul’dan’s machinations, the shadows we worshipped were alluring and powerful. After that chance encounter with the Warden, I made a choice. Perish by my own anguish and be devoured by the abyssal maw, or face my past and ensure I will not be shackled by its crippling grasp.$B$BSpeak, stranger. Will you assist me in becoming the last of the Stormreaver?','I had fled the darkness before. Out of shame. Out of guilt. Out of disgust. My old self revelled in the depravity of Gul’dan’s machinations, the shadows we worshipped were alluring and powerful. After that chance encounter with the Warden, I made a choice. Perish by my own anguish and be devoured by the abyssal maw, or face my past and ensure I will not be shackled by its crippling grasp.$B$BSpeak, stranger. Will you assist me in becoming the last of the Stormreaver?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
