(6272901,'Oh, the wind, it blows through me luscious locks!... Me luscious, beard locks.$B$BYe ever fly? Its such a beautiful feeling, if you want to experience the grace of a freefall with the safety that only I can provide, well, let me know. I can sell such a marvelous feeling for a few coins aye?! Just make sure to deploy the \'chute close to landing. I\'ve had a few folks just fall flat on their face by being too eager...','Oh, the wind, it blows through me luscious locks!... Me luscious, beard locks.$B$BYe ever fly? Its such a beautiful feeling, if you want to experience the grace of a freefall with the safety that only I can provide, well, let me know. I can sell such a marvelous feeling for a few coins aye?! Just make sure to deploy the \'chute close to landing. I\'ve had a few folks just fall flat on their face by being too eager...',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
