(6279501,'It has been some time since I have emerged from our tunnels to gaze upon Moonwhisper Coast...$B$BFragmented alliances and hostilities is all that can be found in this land now... Yet still, I longed to look upon its unique, and beautiful soil once again.','It has been some time since I have emerged from our tunnels to gaze upon Moonwhisper Coast...$B$BFragmented alliances and hostilities is all that can be found in this land now... Yet still, I longed to look upon its unique, and beautiful soil once again.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6279601,'Absolutes are rarely found in nature. A simple mind may think of fire to only be destructive, yet without it, life would not flourish in our world. Keep this wisdom in mind on your journey, else you will keep your true potential from unfurling.','Absolutes are rarely found in nature. A simple mind may think of fire to only be destructive, yet without it, life would not flourish in our world. Keep this wisdom in mind on your journey, else you will keep your true potential from unfurling.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6279801,'The Earthen Ring is always in need of assistance all around Azeroth. If you find members of our order, do not hesitate to support them in our endeavour to heal the Earth Mother’s balance. We will not shy away from rewarding you for your deeds in return.','The Earthen Ring is always in need of assistance all around Azeroth. If you find members of our order, do not hesitate to support them in our endeavour to heal the Earth Mother’s balance. We will not shy away from rewarding you for your deeds in return.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6279901,'If you are here for meditation, please refer to one of the spirit guides. Otherwise, do not disturb the peace of this sanctuary.','If you are here for meditation, please refer to one of the spirit guides. Otherwise, do not disturb the peace of this sanctuary.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6280101,'The new initiates are promising, yet profoundly naive at the same time. It reminds me of my own training, back in Mulgore. The open plains of our ancestral home were captivating and awe-inspiring. Back then, I did not know of the ailments plaguing the Earth Mother. Which is why it is even more important to prepare these younglings for the reality of the world.','The new initiates are promising, yet profoundly naive at the same time. It reminds me of my own training, back in Mulgore. The open plains of our ancestral home were captivating and awe-inspiring. Back then, I did not know of the ailments plaguing the Earth Mother. Which is why it is even more important to prepare these younglings for the reality of the world.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6280301,'Water flows down the path of least resistance. It is adaptive, flexible and resourceful. A gentle description, but given enough time and pressure, the cascade will erode that along with it flows. Never forget that.','Water flows down the path of least resistance. It is adaptive, flexible and resourceful. A gentle description, but given enough time and pressure, the cascade will erode that along with it flows. Never forget that.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6280401,'Commune with the earth. Hear its heartbeat, solemn and steady. The earth bears plenty of secrets waiting to be heard, if you are just willing to listen.','Commune with the earth. Hear its heartbeat, solemn and steady. The earth bears plenty of secrets waiting to be heard, if you are just willing to listen.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6280501,'The Darkspear used to practice ancient voodoo magic to peer into planes beyond our own. We have lost much of that tradition, and while we have learned much from the orcs in the way of shamanism, it is important to me to pass on the knowledge of my tribe to the generations to come.','The Darkspear used to practice ancient voodoo magic to peer into planes beyond our own. We have lost much of that tradition, and while we have learned much from the orcs in the way of shamanism, it is important to me to pass on the knowledge of my tribe to the generations to come.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6283301,'I have spent much of my life wandering these trails, and hunting the wilds of Thousand Needles. It is only recently that danger has encroached upon my land.','I have spent much of my life wandering these trails, and hunting the wilds of Thousand Needles. It is only recently that danger has encroached upon my land.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6283401,'The Windhorn have nearly been eradicated, our home has been stolen from us, and now we are left to wander, as refugees and nomads.$B$BI have returned to this familiar place in search of vengeance. Though this is not something that I can do alone... Will you be the hand of my wrath?','The Windhorn have nearly been eradicated, our home has been stolen from us, and now we are left to wander, as refugees and nomads.$B$BI have returned to this familiar place in search of vengeance. Though this is not something that I can do alone... Will you be the hand of my wrath?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6283501,'Malgan has grown to have spite in his heart. No matter what I do it would appear his mind has been set. I do not blame him, for we have had nearly everything stolen from us. I am only here to make sure he does not end up killed.','Malgan has grown to have spite in his heart. No matter what I do it would appear his mind has been set. I do not blame him, for we have had nearly everything stolen from us. I am only here to make sure he does not end up killed.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6283601,'When I was young a group of centaur slaughtered my family during one of our caravan runs. It was the Windhorn Tribe that rescued me, and adopted me. I am forever in their debt and consider Windhorn Canyon home. It burns at my heart to know that the Grimtotem now reside there.','When I was young a group of centaur slaughtered my family during one of our caravan runs. It was the Windhorn Tribe that rescued me, and adopted me. I am forever in their debt and consider Windhorn Canyon home. It burns at my heart to know that the Grimtotem now reside there.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6283701,'Elder, why do the Grimtotem not harm you as they have the others?','Elder, why do the Grimtotem not harm you as they have the others?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6283702,'<The aged tauren stands before you, his gaze is withered, and somewhat surprised>$B$BHmm, you certainly are not Grimtotem. I must commend you for reaching these peaks, those that currently inhabit this place do not seem too fond of outsiders.$B$B<Skystrider lets out a long, exhaled breath, his eyes gazing over the bluffs of Windhorn Canyon with a glint of radiance>$B$BSuch beauty, is it not? My people roamed these cliffs for generations, carving into the stone. It would appear such a time has passed. My old bones grow more and more weary with each passing year. I can feel it, my time is coming to an end, and just like the Windhorn, I too shall pass.','<The aged tauren stands before you, his gaze is withered, and somewhat surprised>$B$BHmm, you certainly are not Grimtotem. I must commend you for reaching these peaks, those that currently inhabit this place do not seem too fond of outsiders.$B$B<Skystrider lets out a long, exhaled breath, his eyes gazing over the bluffs of Windhorn Canyon with a glint of radiance>$B$BSuch beauty, is it not? My people roamed these cliffs for generations, carving into the stone. It would appear such a time has passed. My old bones grow more and more weary with each passing year. I can feel it, my time is coming to an end, and just like the Windhorn, I too shall pass.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6283801,'Nature has been plentiful in our bounty to procure goods.','Nature has been plentiful in our bounty to procure goods.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6283901,'What happened to make you refugees?','What happened to make you refugees?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6283902,'My family has long lived within the Thousand Needles. It is our ancestral home, and a place that we have walked for what seems to be countless generations. Now all of our lives have been upended, and we find ourselves nothing more than refugees.','My family has long lived within the Thousand Needles. It is our ancestral home, and a place that we have walked for what seems to be countless generations. Now all of our lives have been upended, and we find ourselves nothing more than refugees.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6283903,'The Blackwind is what happened. A vile group of Grimtotem murderers and savages led by one named \'Shalk\' who is their chieftain. They invaded our sacred home, Windhorn Canyon almost a month ago.$B$BThe devastation they brought was horrid, so many innocents were slain in their bloodlust and conquest. Now my tribe has been left to wander, to find a new place to call home... Atleast what is left of us.','The Blackwind is what happened. A vile group of Grimtotem murderers and savages led by one named \'Shalk\' who is their chieftain. They invaded our sacred home, Windhorn Canyon almost a month ago.$B$BThe devastation they brought was horrid, so many innocents were slain in their bloodlust and conquest. Now my tribe has been left to wander, to find a new place to call home... Atleast what is left of us.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6284001,'Such beauty can be found in this land, but also danger. You must keep your wits about you these days, even when traveling the roads.','Such beauty can be found in this land, but also danger. You must keep your wits about you these days, even when traveling the roads.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6284201,'I come from the great lands of Thousand Needles. My outcast tribe has been searching for a new place to call home. We widely regard our Moonhoof brothers and sisters as cousins, so I see no better place to build a new life.','I come from the great lands of Thousand Needles. My outcast tribe has been searching for a new place to call home. We widely regard our Moonhoof brothers and sisters as cousins, so I see no better place to build a new life.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6284401,'The Moonhoof tribe has gained our name from the ancient texts that describe how our great mother once walked with the moons. It is our legacy to uphold these lands, and keep them sacred.','The Moonhoof tribe has gained our name from the ancient texts that describe how our great mother once walked with the moons. It is our legacy to uphold these lands, and keep them sacred.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6284501,'The Blackwind are lucky that I was not present during their great conquest of my home. It burns me with anger to know that I was away on a hunt while they stormed and murdered my friends, and family.','The Blackwind are lucky that I was not present during their great conquest of my home. It burns me with anger to know that I was away on a hunt while they stormed and murdered my friends, and family.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6284601,'It has been a while since we have seen outsiders venture into Moonwhisper Coast. What brings you to these lands?','It has been a while since we have seen outsiders venture into Moonwhisper Coast. What brings you to these lands?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6284701,'I have heard many stories about our Moonhoof cousins from my home at Windhorn Canyon. Exaggerated tales of how they could dance in the stars and bask in the great offerings of the blue child.$B$B<Tagasha lets out a small laugh>$B$BIt is funny how these small tales can be so quickly spiralled into myth.','I have heard many stories about our Moonhoof cousins from my home at Windhorn Canyon. Exaggerated tales of how they could dance in the stars and bask in the great offerings of the blue child.$B$B<Tagasha lets out a small laugh>$B$BIt is funny how these small tales can be so quickly spiralled into myth.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285001,'Okhal-asha, stranger. I am Moro\'gai K\'la, chieftain of my people and I welcome you to our humble village. We are a peaceful folk, having fled our dying homeworld years ago in search of a safe haven. Nevertheless, danger and uncertainty plague my people\'s minds, as sinister forces have begun encroaching, threatening our dream of a new home. If your wish for tranquility resonates with ours, then please: Aid me and my people survive these new risks.','Okhal-asha, stranger. I am Moro\'gai K\'la, chieftain of my people and I welcome you to our humble village. We are a peaceful folk, having fled our dying homeworld years ago in search of a safe haven. Nevertheless, danger and uncertainty plague my people\'s minds, as sinister forces have begun encroaching, threatening our dream of a new home. If your wish for tranquility resonates with ours, then please: Aid me and my people survive these new risks.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285002,'Moro\'gai K\'la, your son and I have some questions for you.','Moro\'gai K\'la, your son and I have some questions for you.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285101,'Greetings, wanderer from afar. Us Draenei revere the sacred Draenethyst, a pure crystal formed from the lifeblood of our homeworld Draenor. When our tribe fled to this place with our ancient Riftwalk magic, residue energy of the process seeped into the ground of your own world. Over time, the once foreign crystals began forming on their own.$B$BWith the ever more swiftly encroaching darkness across these plains, we are barely able to harvest more of the precious Draenethyst. The village is dependent on these gems, as they bear great amounts of power, both spiritually and magically. If you find them during your travels through the coast, don\'t hesitate to bring them to me. I will award you with our finest treasures should you do so.','Greetings, wanderer from afar. Us Draenei revere the sacred Draenethyst, a pure crystal formed from the lifeblood of our homeworld Draenor. When our tribe fled to this place with our ancient Riftwalk magic, residue energy of the process seeped into the ground of your own world. Over time, the once foreign crystals began forming on their own.$B$BWith the ever more swiftly encroaching darkness across these plains, we are barely able to harvest more of the precious Draenethyst. The village is dependent on these gems, as they bear great amounts of power, both spiritually and magically. If you find them during your travels through the coast, don\'t hesitate to bring them to me. I will award you with our finest treasures should you do so.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285201,'Infantile whelps like you just don\'t know how to act around a woman of my age! Always running around without a thought inside your empty heads, you\'ll get yourselves killed if you keep this nonsense up! I have enough bones of reckless youths inside the basket on my back, I don\'t need yours too!','Infantile whelps like you just don\'t know how to act around a woman of my age! Always running around without a thought inside your empty heads, you\'ll get yourselves killed if you keep this nonsense up! I have enough bones of reckless youths inside the basket on my back, I don\'t need yours too!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285301,'Come closer, Parash\'ka. My wares are exquisite and flawless, anything you need for your daily crafting needs.','Come closer, Parash\'ka. My wares are exquisite and flawless, anything you need for your daily crafting needs.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285401,'Our fish is tender and zesty, with just the right amount of spice. Come in and try, Parash\'ka!','Our fish is tender and zesty, with just the right amount of spice. Come in and try, Parash\'ka!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285501,'Day in and day out are we besieged by the Fallen Ones. I\'d appreciate it if you could adhere to the order inside the village, Parash\'ka.','Day in and day out are we besieged by the Fallen Ones. I\'d appreciate it if you could adhere to the order inside the village, Parash\'ka.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285601,'I am tending to the birds of these lands, whom we have been told are called plainstriders. They are an ornery kind, and often stubborn, but patience with them is rewarded. Both their strength and resilience reminds us of the ones from our homeworld. We called them Narak\'la, which means Starglider in your tongue. They were elusive birds, slick feathers and meaty legs, soaring through the starlit skies of Draenor.$B$BCaring for these plainstriders reminds me of home; usually a painful memory, it is a rare form of solace for me.','I am tending to the birds of these lands, whom we have been told are called plainstriders. They are an ornery kind, and often stubborn, but patience with them is rewarded. Both their strength and resilience reminds us of the ones from our homeworld. We called them Narak\'la, which means Starglider in your tongue. They were elusive birds, slick feathers and meaty legs, soaring through the starlit skies of Draenor.$B$BCaring for these plainstriders reminds me of home; usually a painful memory, it is a rare form of solace for me.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285701,'My wares are flawlessly crafted, Parash\'ka. Even a stranger like you can see their sublime quality.','My wares are flawlessly crafted, Parash\'ka. Even a stranger like you can see their sublime quality.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285801,'You look like someone with a keen eye for the excentric. Come close and gaze upon my menagerie of creatures you\'ve never laid eyes upon!','You look like someone with a keen eye for the excentric. Come close and gaze upon my menagerie of creatures you\'ve never laid eyes upon!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6285901,'The lake is calm today, not many fish are taking the bait. What about it, interested in giving it a try yourself?','The lake is calm today, not many fish are taking the bait. What about it, interested in giving it a try yourself?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6286001,'My display of fruits is scarce, but their taste is immaculate regardless.','My display of fruits is scarce, but their taste is immaculate regardless.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6286101,'Draenei cuisine is an acquired taste, the Tauren people could not handle the spiciness typical for our kitchen.','Draenei cuisine is an acquired taste, the Tauren people could not handle the spiciness typical for our kitchen.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6286201,'Trade','Trade',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6286202,'Greetings, $C. I am sure you are surprised to see me among these Draenei, am I not sticking out like a sore thumb. I have ventured the world for many years, learned many of its secrets and ultimately settled down on this bewitched coast. My trade is the jewelcrafting, and I have learned under the best tutor there is. If you are interested in some supplies, I am more than eager to strike a deal with you.','Greetings, $C. I am sure you are surprised to see me among these Draenei, am I not sticking out like a sore thumb. I have ventured the world for many years, learned many of its secrets and ultimately settled down on this bewitched coast. My trade is the jewelcrafting, and I have learned under the best tutor there is. If you are interested in some supplies, I am more than eager to strike a deal with you.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6286301,'Weaving arcane energy requires great amounts of focus. Those who easily falter under its pressure are either torn apart or driven mad. I\'ve seen it countless times with naive acolytes of my people\'s tribes. Tell me, is your kind resilient enough to withstand the sheer energy of the Twisting Nether? I am more than curious.','Weaving arcane energy requires great amounts of focus. Those who easily falter under its pressure are either torn apart or driven mad. I\'ve seen it countless times with naive acolytes of my people\'s tribes. Tell me, is your kind resilient enough to withstand the sheer energy of the Twisting Nether? I am more than curious.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6286401,'The draenei possess eons of ancient leatherworking techniques, passed down from generation to generation. Our profound ways of working with skin and hide remain unmatched, even in this new and foreign world. If you have the needed confidence in your trade skill, then allow me to test your mettle with our very own trials.','The draenei possess eons of ancient leatherworking techniques, passed down from generation to generation. Our profound ways of working with skin and hide remain unmatched, even in this new and foreign world. If you have the needed confidence in your trade skill, then allow me to test your mettle with our very own trials.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6289601,'Ishnu-alah, traveler. What takes you to the moonlit fields of this coast? My comrades and I travel Azeroth in search of adventure, mysteries and the occasional treasure - atleast when it comes to Richard. Just a few months ago we were entangled - quite literally - in a most precarious predicament in the Swamp of Sorrows beyond the Great Sea. It was there where we became acquainted with the venerable Draenei. You can imagine how surprised I was to see them here in Moonwhisper Coast as well. It truly has been ages since I last came here...','Ishnu-alah, traveler. What takes you to the moonlit fields of this coast? My comrades and I travel Azeroth in search of adventure, mysteries and the occasional treasure - atleast when it comes to Richard. Just a few months ago we were entangled - quite literally - in a most precarious predicament in the Swamp of Sorrows beyond the Great Sea. It was there where we became acquainted with the venerable Draenei. You can imagine how surprised I was to see them here in Moonwhisper Coast as well. It truly has been ages since I last came here...',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6289701,'Da land be whispering mysterious words. Unclear and shrouded. Venuris led us to dis coast. Home of her people, a home she remembers differently. De coast be veiled in shadow, boiling underneath, eager to devour careless fools. You better be cautious when traveling de roads. You never know, what be lurkin\' about.','Da land be whispering mysterious words. Unclear and shrouded. Venuris led us to dis coast. Home of her people, a home she remembers differently. De coast be veiled in shadow, boiling underneath, eager to devour careless fools. You better be cautious when traveling de roads. You never know, what be lurkin\' about.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6289801,'I have to say, these Draenei sure know how to cook some spicy food. Not as spicy as the stew we had in the Harborage, must\'ve been because of those swamp herbs. My companions would surely agree. Except Olgra, that woman is always trying to one-up me. But that\'s what makes her so endearing, even if I\'d never tell her that directly. And I hope you won\'t either.','I have to say, these Draenei sure know how to cook some spicy food. Not as spicy as the stew we had in the Harborage, must\'ve been because of those swamp herbs. My companions would surely agree. Except Olgra, that woman is always trying to one-up me. But that\'s what makes her so endearing, even if I\'d never tell her that directly. And I hope you won\'t either.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6289901,'Ghosts! Of course it had to be ghosts. Foolish of me to ever think it could have been anything else than the spirits of the dead. I swear, once we\'re done here I\'ll have Richard be on nightwatch for the next three days.','Ghosts! Of course it had to be ghosts. Foolish of me to ever think it could have been anything else than the spirits of the dead. I swear, once we\'re done here I\'ll have Richard be on nightwatch for the next three days.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6290001,'The land cries out in agony. The ragged chaos it is steeped in is fueled by the countless forces eager to claim its power for their own, with little to no regard for consequences. Us Kaldorei have abandoned these shores for far too long.','The land cries out in agony. The ragged chaos it is steeped in is fueled by the countless forces eager to claim its power for their own, with little to no regard for consequences. Us Kaldorei have abandoned these shores for far too long.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6290101,'This expedition is here on behalf of Commander Shandris Feathermoon. Our scouts have reported strange happenings along the coast, from formerly peaceful furbolgs rampaging through the woods to the local druidic circles abandoning communication. We may have lessened our watch over this coast after the Betrayer razed Nendis, that is correct. Yet this is still Kaldorei land, and as such it is the duty of the vigilant Sentinels to restore order, with an iron fist if necessary.','This expedition is here on behalf of Commander Shandris Feathermoon. Our scouts have reported strange happenings along the coast, from formerly peaceful furbolgs rampaging through the woods to the local druidic circles abandoning communication. We may have lessened our watch over this coast after the Betrayer razed Nendis, that is correct. Yet this is still Kaldorei land, and as such it is the duty of the vigilant Sentinels to restore order, with an iron fist if necessary.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6290201,'An unexpected visitor. I have not much to offer, but please, let me be as hospitable as I can be. My name is Zarazar Sagewind, from the esteemed capital of magic Dalaran. I know that title may be far-fetched, but our architects are making good strides in restoring our great city to its former glory.$B$BThulio and I journeyed to this coast alongside the Sentinel expedition. Regrettably, they are a bit apprehensive when it comes to those mastering the arcane practices. While they allowed me to accompany them here, they forbade me from resting with them in their base camp. A bit shortsighted, if you ask me, but I am more than capable of fending more myself.$B$BNow then, how may I assist you?','An unexpected visitor. I have not much to offer, but please, let me be as hospitable as I can be. My name is Zarazar Sagewind, from the esteemed capital of magic Dalaran. I know that title may be far-fetched, but our architects are making good strides in restoring our great city to its former glory.$B$BThulio and I journeyed to this coast alongside the Sentinel expedition. Regrettably, they are a bit apprehensive when it comes to those mastering the arcane practices. While they allowed me to accompany them here, they forbade me from resting with them in their base camp. A bit shortsighted, if you ask me, but I am more than capable of fending more myself.$B$BNow then, how may I assist you?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6290301,'The coast remains treacherous, through and through. Stay vigilant out there.','The coast remains treacherous, through and through. Stay vigilant out there.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6290401,'It may be unconventional for you to sleep without a roof, but it gives you an excellent opportunity to gaze at the starclad sky at night.','It may be unconventional for you to sleep without a roof, but it gives you an excellent opportunity to gaze at the starclad sky at night.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6290501,'I used to live in Nendis many moons ago, even well before the Third War. Much has changed since then, but there is one thing that\'s perplexing me to this day. The resilience of the Tauren people, those two tribes that settled here so long ago. Frankly, I hadn\'t expected them to survive here for that long, but I was proven different. To my shame, I must admit. Now I see that such hubris is not befitting of me.','I used to live in Nendis many moons ago, even well before the Third War. Much has changed since then, but there is one thing that\'s perplexing me to this day. The resilience of the Tauren people, those two tribes that settled here so long ago. Frankly, I hadn\'t expected them to survive here for that long, but I was proven different. To my shame, I must admit. Now I see that such hubris is not befitting of me.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6290601,'The human that travelled with us carried an interesting sword with him. Sure, he may be a sorcerer, yet if I see such beauty captured in the steel of a blade, I cannot stop admiring it. Please, don\'t say a word of this to the commander. She is rarely open for compromise when it comes to practitioners of the arcane, even if just talked about.','The human that travelled with us carried an interesting sword with him. Sure, he may be a sorcerer, yet if I see such beauty captured in the steel of a blade, I cannot stop admiring it. Please, don\'t say a word of this to the commander. She is rarely open for compromise when it comes to practitioners of the arcane, even if just talked about.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6290701,'The island of Tyrandas used to be of spiritual significance for the Sisterhood of Elune twelve milennia ago. Many of the most devout and respected priestesses completed their religious training in the sacred temple towering above the island.$B$BNow, however, it lies in ruin, abandoned by the Sisterhood. All that remains are its secrets, regrets and mysteries buried beneath a thick layer of shadows.','The island of Tyrandas used to be of spiritual significance for the Sisterhood of Elune twelve milennia ago. Many of the most devout and respected priestesses completed their religious training in the sacred temple towering above the island.$B$BNow, however, it lies in ruin, abandoned by the Sisterhood. All that remains are its secrets, regrets and mysteries buried beneath a thick layer of shadows.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6290801,'Speak clearly. Where can my mighty hippogryphs take you to?','Speak clearly. Where can my mighty hippogryphs take you to?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6291001,'Not many of us are left. This grove used to be full of druids in harmony with the wilds, even despite Tyrandas having long been abandoned. Now those same druids wage war against their own kind. What could drive them to such madness?','Not many of us are left. This grove used to be full of druids in harmony with the wilds, even despite Tyrandas having long been abandoned. Now those same druids wage war against their own kind. What could drive them to such madness?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6291101,'Within the groves of Moonwhisper Coast, we were all disciples of Cenarius, practitioners of his teachings and fellow scholars of nature\'s splendor. No matter if Night Elf or Tauren, under the guidance of Malorne\'s son, we were one. My heart weighs heavily dreading these days to soon be over.','Within the groves of Moonwhisper Coast, we were all disciples of Cenarius, practitioners of his teachings and fellow scholars of nature\'s splendor. No matter if Night Elf or Tauren, under the guidance of Malorne\'s son, we were one. My heart weighs heavily dreading these days to soon be over.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6291201,'My brother Achak and I have many friends in the Grove of the Moon on the mainland. The possibility of them being among the invaders defiling the ruins of Tyrandas is both revolting and saddening.','My brother Achak and I have many friends in the Grove of the Moon on the mainland. The possibility of them being among the invaders defiling the ruins of Tyrandas is both revolting and saddening.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6291301,'Dreadful times are upon us. It will demand everything from us just keeping this sacred clearing safe from evildoers. Are you willing to help us?','Dreadful times are upon us. It will demand everything from us just keeping this sacred clearing safe from evildoers. Are you willing to help us?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6291401,'Bandalar is protecting everyone with everything he’s got. Us sisters of the Wild trust him fully, was it not him who protected us against the Burning Legion during the Third War, too. The dryads will aid him with all their might! The protectors of nature will stand strong and united against the evil of this world.','Bandalar is protecting everyone with everything he’s got. Us sisters of the Wild trust him fully, was it not him who protected us against the Burning Legion during the Third War, too. The dryads will aid him with all their might! The protectors of nature will stand strong and united against the evil of this world.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6291701,'Our brethren are straying from their path. Blinded by the moonlight of Elune\'s child, they are guided by a false premonition. If we don\'t interfere quickly, I am afraid we will lose them forever.','Our brethren are straying from their path. Blinded by the moonlight of Elune\'s child, they are guided by a false premonition. If we don\'t interfere quickly, I am afraid we will lose them forever.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6292001,'Among the Draenei there is nothing more sacred than the venerable art of Riftwalking. Once a widely spread practice, it is now sadly nothing more than an empty shell of the grandeur us Riftwalkers were able to conjure in age-old times; eons ago, under the swirling firmament of Draenor\'s night sky. I fear your kind may not grasp the magnitude of this sorcery, judging from your befuddled look. No need to trouble yourself with foolish contemplations. Riftwalking is a sacred rite, it will not be sullied by you lesser races, even in its current, pitiful state. The weaving of the arcane fabric itself, drawing power from the hallowed Draenethyst; only us Draenei shall possess this power, and no one else.','Among the Draenei there is nothing more sacred than the venerable art of Riftwalking. Once a widely spread practice, it is now sadly nothing more than an empty shell of the grandeur us Riftwalkers were able to conjure in age-old times; eons ago, under the swirling firmament of Draenor\'s night sky. I fear your kind may not grasp the magnitude of this sorcery, judging from your befuddled look. No need to trouble yourself with foolish contemplations. Riftwalking is a sacred rite, it will not be sullied by you lesser races, even in its current, pitiful state. The weaving of the arcane fabric itself, drawing power from the hallowed Draenethyst; only us Draenei shall possess this power, and no one else.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6292002,'Riftmaster, Ar\'lia, son of the chieftain, has this crystal he wants you to inspect.','Riftmaster, Ar\'lia, son of the chieftain, has this crystal he wants you to inspect.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6292101,'I am tending to the flora growing on this island we have settled on. Ever since the tribe drifted here from beyond the Twisting Nether, the plants have steadily worsened over time. The elders and I assume the draenethyst residue that seeped into the soil to be the source of the stress they are suffering from. A regrettable consequence. We have damaged the coast with our arrival and therefore it is our obligation to care for it in turn.','I am tending to the flora growing on this island we have settled on. Ever since the tribe drifted here from beyond the Twisting Nether, the plants have steadily worsened over time. The elders and I assume the draenethyst residue that seeped into the soil to be the source of the stress they are suffering from. A regrettable consequence. We have damaged the coast with our arrival and therefore it is our obligation to care for it in turn.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6292201,'Maintaining our only farm has become increasingly more difficult. Either it is the local wildlife or those wretched servitors causing trouble for me! If only I could return to the days where I was tending to my crops in peace and not in mortal danger.','Maintaining our only farm has become increasingly more difficult. Either it is the local wildlife or those wretched servitors causing trouble for me! If only I could return to the days where I was tending to my crops in peace and not in mortal danger.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6292301,'Speak, Parash\'ka. I have crucial duties to attend to and no time to waste on idle chitchat.','Speak, Parash\'ka. I have crucial duties to attend to and no time to waste on idle chitchat.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6295001,'The Kaldorei have lived in the woods of Kalimdor for countless years, and tamed its ruthlessness. It is not an easy path, but fending and providing for yourself in the great outdoors is crucial if you wish to see the moonlight of the next night.','The Kaldorei have lived in the woods of Kalimdor for countless years, and tamed its ruthlessness. It is not an easy path, but fending and providing for yourself in the great outdoors is crucial if you wish to see the moonlight of the next night.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6295101,'The woods are dangerous, and civilization is often far away. I can teach you how to survive out in the harsh wilderness.','The woods are dangerous, and civilization is often far away. I can teach you how to survive out in the harsh wilderness.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6295201,'If you are in need of vital necessities for your journeys, feel free to browse my wares.','If you are in need of vital necessities for your journeys, feel free to browse my wares.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6295301,'I met Eissinn when I was wandering the high ridges during a heavy snowstorm. Certain my end was near, I cowered behind a stone, trying to stay warm. I soon lost consciousness and when I came back to me, this absolute beast of a lass had hauled me from my hiding spot to her mountain shelter. That\'s when I knew: This woman will be my wife, even if I have to move mountains to make it happen.','I met Eissinn when I was wandering the high ridges during a heavy snowstorm. Certain my end was near, I cowered behind a stone, trying to stay warm. I soon lost consciousness and when I came back to me, this absolute beast of a lass had hauled me from my hiding spot to her mountain shelter. That\'s when I knew: This woman will be my wife, even if I have to move mountains to make it happen.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6295401,'Eager to go out into the wild, eh? A warm hearth and a foamy ale is wonderful and all, but the thrill of a good mountain hike is something irreplaceable. Come closer, and I\'ll tell you the dwarven ways of surviving in the icy cold of Dun Morogh.','Eager to go out into the wild, eh? A warm hearth and a foamy ale is wonderful and all, but the thrill of a good mountain hike is something irreplaceable. Come closer, and I\'ll tell you the dwarven ways of surviving in the icy cold of Dun Morogh.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6295501,'You should always be well prepared when venturing into the wilds. Don\'t underestimate the importance of thorough planning.','You should always be well prepared when venturing into the wilds. Don\'t underestimate the importance of thorough planning.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`entry`,`male_text`,`female_text`,`chat_type`,`sound_id`,`language_id`,`emote_id1`,`emote_id2`,`emote_id3`,`emote_delay1`,`emote_delay2`,`emote_delay3`) VALUES
(6295601,'We have not survived the deadly heat of Durotar by sheer luck. Our people are resilient, but moreso, they are resourceful. You ought to hone your instincts and skill, otherwise you\'ll not make it for long out there.','We have not survived the deadly heat of Durotar by sheer luck. Our people are resilient, but moreso, they are resourceful. You ought to hone your instincts and skill, otherwise you\'ll not make it for long out there.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6295701,'There are many ways in which you can utilize nature to your advantage. With a little bit of creativity and expertise, you can turn even the most mundane things into something useful.','There are many ways in which you can utilize nature to your advantage. With a little bit of creativity and expertise, you can turn even the most mundane things into something useful.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6295801,'The plains offer plentiful bounties, enough to benefit from the Earthmother\'s blessing without depriving her off her natural beauty.','The plains offer plentiful bounties, enough to benefit from the Earthmother\'s blessing without depriving her off her natural beauty.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6295901,'For many years we have traveled across the lands of Kalimdor, persecuted by the centaur marauders. During that time, we learned much from the land, its dangers and its intransigence. If you wish to survive, you have to fight tooth and nail for it, as there is no mercy for you out there.','For many years we have traveled across the lands of Kalimdor, persecuted by the centaur marauders. During that time, we learned much from the land, its dangers and its intransigence. If you wish to survive, you have to fight tooth and nail for it, as there is no mercy for you out there.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6296301,'Having a tough time, rookie? I\'m tellin\' ya, this island ain\'t for the weak. If you wanna make it big, you gotta strive big, and that entails turning anything you find into profit. Wanna lean in and learn my secrets? Sure, sure, but it comes at a price...','Having a tough time, rookie? I\'m tellin\' ya, this island ain\'t for the weak. If you wanna make it big, you gotta strive big, and that entails turning anything you find into profit. Wanna lean in and learn my secrets? Sure, sure, but it comes at a price...',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6296601,'I remember hiding in the forest from the despicable monster calling itself my mother, back when I was not a slave to this curse. Hours at a time, sometimes even days. The skills I had back then I still possess, and I can share my knowledge from that wretched time with you, for a price.','I remember hiding in the forest from the despicable monster calling itself my mother, back when I was not a slave to this curse. Hours at a time, sometimes even days. The skills I had back then I still possess, and I can share my knowledge from that wretched time with you, for a price.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6297301,'Fish under the light of the two moons, and you may one day catch the mythical White-Scaled Eel.','Fish under the light of the two moons, and you may one day catch the mythical White-Scaled Eel.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6297501,'Rest, weary soul, you who are burdened by adventure and whose shoulders carry the weight of mountains when required. Let the incense I burn in my inn fill your nostrils and ease your stiff, tense body. Allow each of your muscles to loosen, each of your bones to crack in relief. Rest. Tomorrow brings another day.','Rest, weary soul, you who are burdened by adventure and whose shoulders carry the weight of mountains when required. Let the incense I burn in my inn fill your nostrils and ease your stiff, tense body. Allow each of your muscles to loosen, each of your bones to crack in relief. Rest. Tomorrow brings another day.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6297601,'Several spirits haunt the Moonwhisper Coast, young one. While some of our ancestors have been disturbed, these hungering, cold, vengeful spirits are of elven nature. I thank the Earthmother that it was my eyes she took, for had she not, I would be forced to gaze upon the night sky and turn my sight away from Mu\'sha, just as she has turned away from our need for aid. Why she allows these vile spirits to torment us, I do not know, for she chooses not to answer.$B$BThankfully, she is not the only one I rely upon. When the pale one turns its light away from us, the blue draws ever closer. If you find yourself in trouble upon our lands, look to the sky for Lo\'sho, young one. He will listen, when others will not.','Several spirits haunt the Moonwhisper Coast, young one. While some of our ancestors have been disturbed, these hungering, cold, vengeful spirits are of elven nature. I thank the Earthmother that it was my eyes she took, for had she not, I would be forced to gaze upon the night sky and turn my sight away from Mu\'sha, just as she has turned away from our need for aid. Why she allows these vile spirits to torment us, I do not know, for she chooses not to answer.$B$BThankfully, she is not the only one I rely upon. When the pale one turns its light away from us, the blue draws ever closer. If you find yourself in trouble upon our lands, look to the sky for Lo\'sho, young one. He will listen, when others will not.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6297701,'The tribe is in great peril, and yet my father turns a blind eye to it. He has grown stubborn, obsessed even. He sees nothing but An\'she. He looks nowhere but to the sky, whether by day when its light burns or by night when it shines through Mu\'sha. He is so fixed in his belief that he will not listen to reason. The people, our people, those who left the village, did so out of fear and neglect.$B$BIt pains me to speak ill of my own parent. Earthmother hold me, I can no longer stand by and simply watch. I will not shed the blood of my kin over a dispute of absent idols.$B$BYou are an outsider here, and so I ask you to listen not only to my frustration. Be a friend to me in this time of need, and I will never forget the debt I owe you.','The tribe is in great peril, and yet my father turns a blind eye to it. He has grown stubborn, obsessed even. He sees nothing but An\'she. He looks nowhere but to the sky, whether by day when its light burns or by night when it shines through Mu\'sha. He is so fixed in his belief that he will not listen to reason. The people, our people, those who left the village, did so out of fear and neglect.$B$BIt pains me to speak ill of my own parent. Earthmother hold me, I can no longer stand by and simply watch. I will not shed the blood of my kin over a dispute of absent idols.$B$BYou are an outsider here, and so I ask you to listen not only to my frustration. Be a friend to me in this time of need, and I will never forget the debt I owe you.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6297801,'Step closer, adventurer. The wares of Moonhoof Village are one-of-a-kind and of immaculate quality. Anything your heart desires; and more!','Step closer, adventurer. The wares of Moonhoof Village are one-of-a-kind and of immaculate quality. Anything your heart desires; and more!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6298001,'The Earthen Ring has come to investigate the turbulent behavior of the local elementals. They are far too restless here. Blessed be the Loa, it keeps me away from the sand and dust for a while. As a sand troll, ever since our Sandmoon Village joined the Horde, fleeing Tanaris was my greatest dream. Imagine my surprise when I reached Durotar and traded sand for dust. Even the Earthen Ring keeps its circle in Stonetalon. When all this is done, I might even ask the Moonhoof Tribe to let me stay.','The Earthen Ring has come to investigate the turbulent behavior of the local elementals. They are far too restless here. Blessed be the Loa, it keeps me away from the sand and dust for a while. As a sand troll, ever since our Sandmoon Village joined the Horde, fleeing Tanaris was my greatest dream. Imagine my surprise when I reached Durotar and traded sand for dust. Even the Earthen Ring keeps its circle in Stonetalon. When all this is done, I might even ask the Moonhoof Tribe to let me stay.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6298101,'Do not listen to that foolish Uz\'tuk. He favors the air elementals. Hmph. A weakling who used to cower in the sand. Yet he is strong in a fight, even when lurking in the shadows. He may be the best companion I have had since joining the Earthen Ring. Apart from Muddoll, of course.$B$BBehold, a true elemental. The earth shakes as it moves. The stone breaks in its wake. Truly the embodiment of the orcish desire for both strength and honor. No element is more sturdy, more beautiful, than the very earth you walk on.$B$B<Lotka clears her throat.>$B$BI may have gotten carried away there. You saw nothing.','Do not listen to that foolish Uz\'tuk. He favors the air elementals. Hmph. A weakling who used to cower in the sand. Yet he is strong in a fight, even when lurking in the shadows. He may be the best companion I have had since joining the Earthen Ring. Apart from Muddoll, of course.$B$BBehold, a true elemental. The earth shakes as it moves. The stone breaks in its wake. Truly the embodiment of the orcish desire for both strength and honor. No element is more sturdy, more beautiful, than the very earth you walk on.$B$B<Lotka clears her throat.>$B$BI may have gotten carried away there. You saw nothing.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6298301,'Several odd crystals have been sighted around these lands. One of the Moonhoof tribesmen reported this in Thunder Bluff, and it seems the Royal Apothecary finds it rather interesting. I was tasked with the research, which is, frankly, probably the worst idea possible. I am no fighter. I have never held a weapon in my life. And while I have all the time I need to study these crystals, I fear they will turn to dust long before anyone makes a proper fighter out of me.$B$BYou look like the adventuring type. Why not help me?','Several odd crystals have been sighted around these lands. One of the Moonhoof tribesmen reported this in Thunder Bluff, and it seems the Royal Apothecary finds it rather interesting. I was tasked with the research, which is, frankly, probably the worst idea possible. I am no fighter. I have never held a weapon in my life. And while I have all the time I need to study these crystals, I fear they will turn to dust long before anyone makes a proper fighter out of me.$B$BYou look like the adventuring type. Why not help me?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6298401,'I can still smell the smoke emanating from Riverhorn Village. It clings to the air, reminding me of that terrible tragedy.','I can still smell the smoke emanating from Riverhorn Village. It clings to the air, reminding me of that terrible tragedy.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6298601,'I welcome you to Moro\'gai village. My name is Ar\'lia, son of Moro\'gai K\'la, our chieftain. We seldom get visitors, especially in these turbulent times; still, you are free to make yourself at home in our midst.','I welcome you to Moro\'gai village. My name is Ar\'lia, son of Moro\'gai K\'la, our chieftain. We seldom get visitors, especially in these turbulent times; still, you are free to make yourself at home in our midst.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6298701,'<The draenei has been beaten and lies motionless on the ground.>','<The draenei has been beaten and lies motionless on the ground.>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6298702,'<Inspect the hunter\'s body>','<Inspect the hunter\'s body>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6298703,'<Countless lesions and cuts are strewn about the draenei\'s body. His left arm is contorted into an unnatural shape. You can\'t discern whether the red trails under his eyes were caused by tears or blood. He fought to the very end.>','<Countless lesions and cuts are strewn about the draenei\'s body. His left arm is contorted into an unnatural shape. You can\'t discern whether the red trails under his eyes were caused by tears or blood. He fought to the very end.>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6298901,'He hungers...','He hungers...',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6299301,'This world is full of wonders and excitement. When I find one intriguing thing, another pops up around the corner!','This world is full of wonders and excitement. When I find one intriguing thing, another pops up around the corner!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6301601,'Mawa’jini and Grahm have been arguing the entire morning about what Spirit Guide Tohnitze had been saying about the essence of earth. But judging from what they are spouting, I doubt they even listened to what she actually said.','Mawa’jini and Grahm have been arguing the entire morning about what Spirit Guide Tohnitze had been saying about the essence of earth. But judging from what they are spouting, I doubt they even listened to what she actually said.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6301701,'Grahm is a fool. Earth is an element of strength! With it, you can crush your enemies with ease.','Grahm is a fool. Earth is an element of strength! With it, you can crush your enemies with ease.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6301801,'Mawa’jini doesn’t have what it takes to become a proper shaman. He thinks the element of earth is used to defeat your enemies, when in reality its purpose is to protect the weak. Everybody knows that.','Mawa’jini doesn’t have what it takes to become a proper shaman. He thinks the element of earth is used to defeat your enemies, when in reality its purpose is to protect the weak. Everybody knows that.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6301901,'Master Rockmane tasked me with deciphering these tablets. They are of ancient tauren heritage, when the Earthen Ring was still young. Back then the naturalists of the order spoke in Kalimag, the language of the elements. Nowadays the knowledge about this language is long gone and it takes a considerable amount of time to translate it into Orcish. But I am determined to fulfill Master Rockmane’s task, no matter how long it may take.','Master Rockmane tasked me with deciphering these tablets. They are of ancient tauren heritage, when the Earthen Ring was still young. Back then the naturalists of the order spoke in Kalimag, the language of the elements. Nowadays the knowledge about this language is long gone and it takes a considerable amount of time to translate it into Orcish. But I am determined to fulfill Master Rockmane’s task, no matter how long it may take.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6302101,'The initiates have to prepare the food they eat all by themselves. This trains discipline and teaches awareness about one’s diet. A strong mind requires a strong body, and without a strong mind communion with the elements is not possible.','The initiates have to prepare the food they eat all by themselves. This trains discipline and teaches awareness about one’s diet. A strong mind requires a strong body, and without a strong mind communion with the elements is not possible.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6304401,'The Fallen Ones surround Moro\'gai Village like vultures circling over a dying animal. To think some of them were once our friends…','The Fallen Ones surround Moro\'gai Village like vultures circling over a dying animal. To think some of them were once our friends…',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6304501,'My brother Eka\'ghar joined Elder Bhu\'robi in his delusion. He has always been gullible, but to think he\'d abandon us all so easily… Father would have been deeply ashamed if he was still with us.','My brother Eka\'ghar joined Elder Bhu\'robi in his delusion. He has always been gullible, but to think he\'d abandon us all so easily… Father would have been deeply ashamed if he was still with us.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6304601,'Hunting along the coast has become increasingly more difficult. Now with the Fallen Ones roaming about, there is rarely any real opportunity to hunt. Still that fool Toruu was adamant on going out… So much recklessness and potential in that kid, it is honestly a headache trying to mentor him. I wonder how Nar\'lan does it. He seems to be a natural when it comes to the youthful Toruu.','Hunting along the coast has become increasingly more difficult. Now with the Fallen Ones roaming about, there is rarely any real opportunity to hunt. Still that fool Toruu was adamant on going out… So much recklessness and potential in that kid, it is honestly a headache trying to mentor him. I wonder how Nar\'lan does it. He seems to be a natural when it comes to the youthful Toruu.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6304602,'Tooru has become one of the Fallen Ones. He tortured Nar’lan and paid with his life for it.','Tooru has become one of the Fallen Ones. He tortured Nar’lan and paid with his life for it.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6304603,'<Fan Dhe’ra has a solemn expression on her face. Her gaze wanders off into the distance, floating above the azure horizon.>$B$BI thank you for telling me that. Toruu was a troublemaker, but he was ambitious. He saw something more in this new world than some of the older hunters of the tribe. I reckon his youth played a big part in that. Yet ambitions and foolishness often go hand in hand, regrettably. And his fate is proof of that.','<Fan Dhe’ra has a solemn expression on her face. Her gaze wanders off into the distance, floating above the azure horizon.>$B$BI thank you for telling me that. Toruu was a troublemaker, but he was ambitious. He saw something more in this new world than some of the older hunters of the tribe. I reckon his youth played a big part in that. Yet ambitions and foolishness often go hand in hand, regrettably. And his fate is proof of that.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6304701,'The Fallen Ones will pay for their sacriligious transgressions. I will not stand idly by and have them overrun Moro\'gai Village!','The Fallen Ones will pay for their sacriligious transgressions. I will not stand idly by and have them overrun Moro\'gai Village!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6304801,'We\'ve tamed a few of these birds, they are mighty and awe-inspiring creatures that can carry a great amount of weight. Still, they are stubborn and won\'t let us Draenei ride on their backs. Perhaps you have more luck?','We\'ve tamed a few of these birds, they are mighty and awe-inspiring creatures that can carry a great amount of weight. Still, they are stubborn and won\'t let us Draenei ride on their backs. Perhaps you have more luck?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6304901,'Mother said we should hide in the inn for now, but I would rather play outside with Ar\'lia.','Mother said we should hide in the inn for now, but I would rather play outside with Ar\'lia.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6305401,'To think the Moonhoof chief would turn me away, and yet allow those foolish Windhorns an audience. The Matron will be heavily displeased. At least not all ears have shut themselves off from our whispers.','To think the Moonhoof chief would turn me away, and yet allow those foolish Windhorns an audience. The Matron will be heavily displeased. At least not all ears have shut themselves off from our whispers.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6305601,'With each passing day, I miss my younger brother more and more. Yet while I chose the path of the hammer to craft for our tribe, his was a different one. He left home for Bloodhoof Village, where he would one day become a great warrior. As much as I miss him, I dream of the day he returns, a man with a fulfilled goal.','With each passing day, I miss my younger brother more and more. Yet while I chose the path of the hammer to craft for our tribe, his was a different one. He left home for Bloodhoof Village, where he would one day become a great warrior. As much as I miss him, I dream of the day he returns, a man with a fulfilled goal.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6305701,'Alert: Challenger approaches.$B$BProcessing.$B$BTarget has been acknowledged as harmless. Proceed.','Alert: Challenger approaches.$B$BProcessing.$B$BTarget has been acknowledged as harmless. Proceed.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6305901,'Another outsider. Come, rest under my roof. I hope you do not mind company. This goblin and his odd companion were refused entry, and so they too were in need of rest.','Another outsider. Come, rest under my roof. I hope you do not mind company. This goblin and his odd companion were refused entry, and so they too were in need of rest.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6306001,'I have travelled all the way from Sparkwater Port to offer my help to this tribe, and yet they refused to allow me entry into their village. Thankfully, this elder allowed me to rest in his hut. Perhaps he took pity on me, since he too feels like an outsider among them.','I have travelled all the way from Sparkwater Port to offer my help to this tribe, and yet they refused to allow me entry into their village. Thankfully, this elder allowed me to rest in his hut. Perhaps he took pity on me, since he too feels like an outsider among them.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6306901,'My tools are both practical and durable! Come and be impressed by Draenei craftsmanship!','My tools are both practical and durable! Come and be impressed by Draenei craftsmanship!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6307001,'This isn\'t exactly how I imagined my retirement voyage to end like...','This isn\'t exactly how I imagined my retirement voyage to end like...',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6307101,'The swamp is without remorse. One small misstep, a breaking twig or even the fumes of the bog can be enough to bring even the most battlehardened warrior to their knees. If you are willing to listen and pay, I can train you in more advanced survival techniques that may save your life out there.','The swamp is without remorse. One small misstep, a breaking twig or even the fumes of the bog can be enough to bring even the most battlehardened warrior to their knees. If you are willing to listen and pay, I can train you in more advanced survival techniques that may save your life out there.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6307201,'The rest of Desolace used to be more akin to the greenery you see here at Nijel\'s Point. But eventually, all life got drained from its soil and only barren death remained. If you are willing to listen and pay, I can tutor you in more advanced survival techniques that may save your life out there.','The rest of Desolace used to be more akin to the greenery you see here at Nijel\'s Point. But eventually, all life got drained from its soil and only barren death remained. If you are willing to listen and pay, I can tutor you in more advanced survival techniques that may save your life out there.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6307501,'The wisp floats around the trees, releasing a wonderful melody echoing throughout the forest.','The wisp floats around the trees, releasing a wonderful melody echoing throughout the forest.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6307601,'The mighty hippogryph isn\'t paying attention to you. You are not worthy of even a slight glance.','The mighty hippogryph isn\'t paying attention to you. You are not worthy of even a slight glance.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6307701,'Lord Neptulon is sending us envoys out into your world to suppress the rising aggression by the element of fire. A warning you should heed as well, mortal; as his wisdom is both infallible and infinite.','Lord Neptulon is sending us envoys out into your world to suppress the rising aggression by the element of fire. A warning you should heed as well, mortal; as his wisdom is both infallible and infinite.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6307801,'<Kralt looks intrigued by your presence>$B$BOutsider, I am Kralt, once one of the Timbermaw, and sadly the last of my kind still walking Moonwhisper Coast. The Blackroot saw to our people abandoning this place some time ago after they were lost to madness.$B$BThat was quite a while ago now, and I tend to keep to myself. If you\'re ever around, feel free to stop by.','<Kralt looks intrigued by your presence>$B$BOutsider, I am Kralt, once one of the Timbermaw, and sadly the last of my kind still walking Moonwhisper Coast. The Blackroot saw to our people abandoning this place some time ago after they were lost to madness.$B$BThat was quite a while ago now, and I tend to keep to myself. If you\'re ever around, feel free to stop by.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6308301,'Why hello there young one, I am Elder Starstrider. I am the one who looks after our most sacred rituals and ceremonies, and have been entrusted to our traditions.$B$BAlready many have begun to migrate here in anticipation for the celebration of the Blue Child\'s return. It is said that the return of the Blue Child is to herald a new chapter in our tribes vaunted history.$B$BWhatever the Blue Child\'s return may mean, it is a special ocassion, one that warrants celebration, and ritual to honor our ancestors.','Why hello there young one, I am Elder Starstrider. I am the one who looks after our most sacred rituals and ceremonies, and have been entrusted to our traditions.$B$BAlready many have begun to migrate here in anticipation for the celebration of the Blue Child\'s return. It is said that the return of the Blue Child is to herald a new chapter in our tribes vaunted history.$B$BWhatever the Blue Child\'s return may mean, it is a special ocassion, one that warrants celebration, and ritual to honor our ancestors.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6308401,'The power of nature itself can be an invigorating force. In dark times such as these it is up to the hands of Druids to tend to nature, and mend the scars left by evil.','The power of nature itself can be an invigorating force. In dark times such as these it is up to the hands of Druids to tend to nature, and mend the scars left by evil.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6308601,'I swear there is a new star in the night sky with each passing day.','I swear there is a new star in the night sky with each passing day.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6308701,'Ah, a new sheep looks to join our flock? Many have already begun to gather here for the coming ceremony, and many others have come to find shelter from the wolves at our doorstep.$B$BIt would appear this dawning of the Blue Child has certainly come at an opportune time.','Ah, a new sheep looks to join our flock? Many have already begun to gather here for the coming ceremony, and many others have come to find shelter from the wolves at our doorstep.$B$BIt would appear this dawning of the Blue Child has certainly come at an opportune time.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6309401,'Behold, I am Bulrok, one of the Cloudhoof.$B$B<Bulrok gazes upon you, as if this name is supposed to garner respect>$B$BBah, you do not know the name? You\'re much like the others, ignorant, and blind to our history. My tribe once held control over the Thousand Needles long ago and exerted influence over the Tauren.$B$B<Bulrok scoffs arrogantly, raising his chin at this affront.>','Behold, I am Bulrok, one of the Cloudhoof.$B$B<Bulrok gazes upon you, as if this name is supposed to garner respect>$B$BBah, you do not know the name? You\'re much like the others, ignorant, and blind to our history. My tribe once held control over the Thousand Needles long ago and exerted influence over the Tauren.$B$B<Bulrok scoffs arrogantly, raising his chin at this affront.>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6309501,'Earthmother be kind to you, and watch your path.','Earthmother be kind to you, and watch your path.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6309601,'Be at peace young one. It is our duty to bring harmony to the tribes, and navigate the evils of this world.','Be at peace young one. It is our duty to bring harmony to the tribes, and navigate the evils of this world.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6309701,'We must be the light in the darkness, to guide those who cannot find the path of redemption. It is up to us loyal priests to keep the unity of the Tauren.$B$BThere are many perils in this world and corruption toward darkness can be found from the most unlikely places. Many look to us for direction, and we must point them on the familiar path, the one trodden by our ancestors before us.$B$BSpirituality, and tradition are hand in hand, bound in unison. We cannot exist without one, just as we cannot exist without eachother.','We must be the light in the darkness, to guide those who cannot find the path of redemption. It is up to us loyal priests to keep the unity of the Tauren.$B$BThere are many perils in this world and corruption toward darkness can be found from the most unlikely places. Many look to us for direction, and we must point them on the familiar path, the one trodden by our ancestors before us.$B$BSpirituality, and tradition are hand in hand, bound in unison. We cannot exist without one, just as we cannot exist without eachother.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6309801,'You come to seek guidance, to seek wisdom? Such things can be found from searching within and identifying your inner self. You would be surprised just how much spirit and fortitude lays deep in ones heart.','You come to seek guidance, to seek wisdom? Such things can be found from searching within and identifying your inner self. You would be surprised just how much spirit and fortitude lays deep in ones heart.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6310601,'The naga creep onto the land and spread their influence wherever they can. Their plans must be sinister, I can feel it.','The naga creep onto the land and spread their influence wherever they can. Their plans must be sinister, I can feel it.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6311801,'I am charged to secure Moonhoof Village from threats that encroach upon our borders. Though it seems as of recently I have become a babysitter tasked with keeping the peace.$B$BThere have been a few squabbles which I have had to sort through, so please do not add fuel to the fire.','I am charged to secure Moonhoof Village from threats that encroach upon our borders. Though it seems as of recently I have become a babysitter tasked with keeping the peace.$B$BThere have been a few squabbles which I have had to sort through, so please do not add fuel to the fire.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6311901,'Truly a disaster, to be sent here by that fool of a cousin of mine. Of all the places one might be assigned, it had to be this - so distant, so very odd.$B$BThese lands are strange, yes, but do not mistake my displeasure for weakness. I did not come all this way to fail. Whatever trials await, I will endure them, and I will see my mission done..','Truly a disaster, to be sent here by that fool of a cousin of mine. Of all the places one might be assigned, it had to be this - so distant, so very odd.$B$BThese lands are strange, yes, but do not mistake my displeasure for weakness. I did not come all this way to fail. Whatever trials await, I will endure them, and I will see my mission done..',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6311902,'Tell me your story, Andanil','Tell me your story, Andanil',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6311903,'My venerable cousin, in what he no doubt considers unmatched wisdom, sent us to this forsaken place chasing draenethyst. Promises of abundance. Of answers. Of being remembered as saviors.$B$BYes, the crystals are impressive. Potent, refined, useful. They keep our people standing a little longer. They quiet the hunger. But that is all they do. Sustenance. Not salvation. I did not cross half the world to return to Alah’thalas carrying crates of arcane crystals.$B$BSo I pushed further. Against advice. Against caution. Against that quiet voice that suggests restraint.','My venerable cousin, in what he no doubt considers unmatched wisdom, sent us to this forsaken place chasing draenethyst. Promises of abundance. Of answers. Of being remembered as saviors.$B$BYes, the crystals are impressive. Potent, refined, useful. They keep our people standing a little longer. They quiet the hunger. But that is all they do. Sustenance. Not salvation. I did not cross half the world to return to Alah’thalas carrying crates of arcane crystals.$B$BSo I pushed further. Against advice. Against caution. Against that quiet voice that suggests restraint.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6311904,'<continue>','<continue>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6311905,'North of here lies an old Barrow Den. Forgotten. Abandoned. Or so it appeared. The place bled magic. Not wild, not crude, but dense. Ancient. The sort that makes your skin prickle even before a spell is cast.$B$BMaelion took a sizeable force and went inside. Capable soldiers. Trained arcanists. People I trusted. Then we heard it. An explosion. Not sound alone. A pressure in the air, like the world itself flinched.$B$BWhen we reached the den, there was nothing left of them. Not truly. Their bodies remained, but the mana was gone. Drained clean. Empty shells, withered beyond recognition. Worse than the withered back home. Those at least remember who they were. These ones do not remember anything. Not their names. Not their purpose. Not even fear.','North of here lies an old Barrow Den. Forgotten. Abandoned. Or so it appeared. The place bled magic. Not wild, not crude, but dense. Ancient. The sort that makes your skin prickle even before a spell is cast.$B$BMaelion took a sizeable force and went inside. Capable soldiers. Trained arcanists. People I trusted. Then we heard it. An explosion. Not sound alone. A pressure in the air, like the world itself flinched.$B$BWhen we reached the den, there was nothing left of them. Not truly. Their bodies remained, but the mana was gone. Drained clean. Empty shells, withered beyond recognition. Worse than the withered back home. Those at least remember who they were. These ones do not remember anything. Not their names. Not their purpose. Not even fear.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6311906,'<continue>','<continue>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6311907,'They did not leave the den. They still roam it. Searching. Or guarding. I cannot tell which is more unsettling.$B$BWhatever happened there involved power far beyond draenethyst. Power that can wither a mage in moments. And that is precisely why it matters. If something can do this, so completely and so quickly, then it stands to reason that it might do the opposite as well.$B$BYes, I know. Theory. Speculation. Desperation, if you prefer honesty. But desperation is where breakthroughs are born.$B$BI will not return to Alah’thalas empty handed. Not with excuses. Not with crystals anyone could have gathered. Whatever lies within that Barrow Den is the reason we are here. I can feel it.$B$BAnd I intend to claim it, whatever the cost.','They did not leave the den. They still roam it. Searching. Or guarding. I cannot tell which is more unsettling.$B$BWhatever happened there involved power far beyond draenethyst. Power that can wither a mage in moments. And that is precisely why it matters. If something can do this, so completely and so quickly, then it stands to reason that it might do the opposite as well.$B$BYes, I know. Theory. Speculation. Desperation, if you prefer honesty. But desperation is where breakthroughs are born.$B$BI will not return to Alah’thalas empty handed. Not with excuses. Not with crystals anyone could have gathered. Whatever lies within that Barrow Den is the reason we are here. I can feel it.$B$BAnd I intend to claim it, whatever the cost.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6312001,'I am the great Pysan!$B$BKnown far and wide as the Righteous to my allies, and the Vengeant to my enemies! I have battled dragons atop mountains, rescued maidens from towers both high and precarious, and struck down evildoers too numerous to count!$B$BI have faced the dreaded hydra Trioch and lived to tell the tale, ventured into the darkest depths of Maraudon, and brought justice to the wicked lurking in Razorfen Downs!$B$BTales of my deeds spread far and wide, sung by bards in every tavern and hall!$B$BAnd yet… ahem… despite all this glory, I must ask - have you, by some miracle, happened to see my sword anywhere?','I am the great Pysan!$B$BKnown far and wide as the Righteous to my allies, and the Vengeant to my enemies! I have battled dragons atop mountains, rescued maidens from towers both high and precarious, and struck down evildoers too numerous to count!$B$BI have faced the dreaded hydra Trioch and lived to tell the tale, ventured into the darkest depths of Maraudon, and brought justice to the wicked lurking in Razorfen Downs!$B$BTales of my deeds spread far and wide, sung by bards in every tavern and hall!$B$BAnd yet… ahem… despite all this glory, I must ask - have you, by some miracle, happened to see my sword anywhere?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6312101,'Ah… a friendly face in such unfriendly lands.$B$B<Tesania smiles, a shadow curling at the edges of her expression.>$B$BHave you truly come all this way to aid us in our… endeavor?','Ah… a friendly face in such unfriendly lands.$B$B<Tesania smiles, a shadow curling at the edges of her expression.>$B$BHave you truly come all this way to aid us in our… endeavor?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6312201,'Do not trust these… creatures that lurk in the bog. They watch from the mist, patient and silent. $B$BThey strike only when you have already let your guard fall.','Do not trust these… creatures that lurk in the bog. They watch from the mist, patient and silent. $B$BThey strike only when you have already let your guard fall.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6312501,'Apologies for my brother… he still hasn’t come to terms with… this. The hunger gnaws at him, as it does at many of us. That is why we are here, actually. In Alah’thalas, many believe these crystals - yes, those crystals - might turn back the withering, might yet save us all.$B$B<Kallion laughs hysterically>$B$BDon’t believe a word of it. They don’t care for withered kin like us. All they offer is a sliver of hope, just enough to keep us crawling forward.','Apologies for my brother… he still hasn’t come to terms with… this. The hunger gnaws at him, as it does at many of us. That is why we are here, actually. In Alah’thalas, many believe these crystals - yes, those crystals - might turn back the withering, might yet save us all.$B$B<Kallion laughs hysterically>$B$BDon’t believe a word of it. They don’t care for withered kin like us. All they offer is a sliver of hope, just enough to keep us crawling forward.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6312601,'What? Never seen a withered before? Hah… keep staring and you’ll regret it. $B$BNow get lost - before the hunger takes me, and I decide you’ll do just fine as my next draught.','What? Never seen a withered before? Hah… keep staring and you’ll regret it. $B$BNow get lost - before the hunger takes me, and I decide you’ll do just fine as my next draught.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6312701,'Never have I felt magic like this, so unfamiliar, yet so potent. The air itself hums with it. And these crystals… they are no mere curiosities. $B$BI cannot help but wonder - might they hold the key to our people’s salvation?','Never have I felt magic like this, so unfamiliar, yet so potent. The air itself hums with it. And these crystals… they are no mere curiosities. $B$BI cannot help but wonder - might they hold the key to our people’s salvation?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6316301,'Our ancestors have been disturbed. The grounds are no longer a safe place to mourn those who have left us behind.','Our ancestors have been disturbed. The grounds are no longer a safe place to mourn those who have left us behind.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6316801,'Be wary, the Frostmane seem to be encroaching on our borders, and testing our patience.','Be wary, the Frostmane seem to be encroaching on our borders, and testing our patience.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6317101,'Draenei history is carved into tablets, cementing them into the annals of time for all eternity. Many of our stories and folklore had been lost following the destruction of our home Draenor, which is why it is all the more important for me to archive the history of our people onto these stone tablets. It is a responsibility I shoulder with great pride.','Draenei history is carved into tablets, cementing them into the annals of time for all eternity. Many of our stories and folklore had been lost following the destruction of our home Draenor, which is why it is all the more important for me to archive the history of our people onto these stone tablets. It is a responsibility I shoulder with great pride.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6317401,'The Moonhoof used to partake in a sacred hunt along this coast. The kodos’ hides were used to craft ceremonial drums and their meat offered sustenance for many days to come. But now that these alien parasites run rampant, we cannot uphold our own traditions anymore.','The Moonhoof used to partake in a sacred hunt along this coast. The kodos’ hides were used to craft ceremonial drums and their meat offered sustenance for many days to come. But now that these alien parasites run rampant, we cannot uphold our own traditions anymore.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6317501,'I am worried, $C. The Youngbloods grow up in a time of turmoil and uncertainty. We lived in harmony for many moons in our humble village, minding our own business and keeping mostly to ourselves. Seeing what dangers roam outside our walls, and at what alarming speed they spread across the coast, I fear for the survival of our tribe. Just what are we to make of this fate? The Earthmother must be testing our resolve, it must be.','I am worried, $C. The Youngbloods grow up in a time of turmoil and uncertainty. We lived in harmony for many moons in our humble village, minding our own business and keeping mostly to ourselves. Seeing what dangers roam outside our walls, and at what alarming speed they spread across the coast, I fear for the survival of our tribe. Just what are we to make of this fate? The Earthmother must be testing our resolve, it must be.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6317601,'I traveled here from Revantusk Village, far far to the east in the Hinterlands. Chatty adventurers like yourself told me of this azure coast where the fish are as beautiful as they are big. Naturally I got eager to prove to my tribesmen that the great Ghujabi can fish any fish, be it at home or in the far reaches of the world. They’ll be singing songs about me when I return!','I traveled here from Revantusk Village, far far to the east in the Hinterlands. Chatty adventurers like yourself told me of this azure coast where the fish are as beautiful as they are big. Naturally I got eager to prove to my tribesmen that the great Ghujabi can fish any fish, be it at home or in the far reaches of the world. They’ll be singing songs about me when I return!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6317701,'<The defender grunts in pain.>','<The defender grunts in pain.>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6317901,'Weary from your pilgrimage? Come rest a bit and let your mind become one with nature.','Weary from your pilgrimage? Come rest a bit and let your mind become one with nature.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6318001,'Min’pha and I are playing Taaham Tuura! Do you want to join us? It’s my favourite game to play, you just take this small net and try to fish as many of the small fishies as you can! You have to be really patient and calm to win.','Min’pha and I are playing Taaham Tuura! Do you want to join us? It’s my favourite game to play, you just take this small net and try to fish as many of the small fishies as you can! You have to be really patient and calm to win.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6318101,'Terem Kalan made the nets for Taaham Tuura, but I think he is cheating and made his net way more sturdier than mine! Isn’t that just mean?','Terem Kalan made the nets for Taaham Tuura, but I think he is cheating and made his net way more sturdier than mine! Isn’t that just mean?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6318301,'The ghosts roaming this coast don’t realize their undead predicament. In their broken minds, they still serve Queen Azshara, as they had twelve thousand years ago. What sounds like a terrible fate is more of a nuisance really. Atleast for me. You can’t imagine how irritating they can be, talking about the same things day in and day out. Drives you crazy.','The ghosts roaming this coast don’t realize their undead predicament. In their broken minds, they still serve Queen Azshara, as they had twelve thousand years ago. What sounds like a terrible fate is more of a nuisance really. Atleast for me. You can’t imagine how irritating they can be, talking about the same things day in and day out. Drives you crazy.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6318901,'Hey now, watch where you\'re walking around here. I\'ve known more than one heavy-footed dwarf to knock over a crate of supplies, and I don\'t need you to do the same.','Hey now, watch where you\'re walking around here. I\'ve known more than one heavy-footed dwarf to knock over a crate of supplies, and I don\'t need you to do the same.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6319001,'Woah now, there is no need for any hostilities between us. Let\'s keep it cool and calm.','Woah now, there is no need for any hostilities between us. Let\'s keep it cool and calm.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6319801,'Lok\'tar. A fine day to spill dragon blood, is it not? You seem uncertain and un eager. Fret not. While I am of the Dragonmaw, I fly my colors with the Horde, under the Scalereaver Warband. Mischief and mayhem may seem to live at our core, but I tell you, wanderer, we are those who raise arms against the stronger inhabitants of Azeroth when the time for action comes.','Lok\'tar. A fine day to spill dragon blood, is it not? You seem uncertain and un eager. Fret not. While I am of the Dragonmaw, I fly my colors with the Horde, under the Scalereaver Warband. Mischief and mayhem may seem to live at our core, but I tell you, wanderer, we are those who raise arms against the stronger inhabitants of Azeroth when the time for action comes.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6320601,'I am ready to face the chaos of war and prove my strength on the battlefield. [Enable War Mode]','I am ready to face the chaos of war and prove my strength on the battlefield. [Enable War Mode]',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(6320602,'Vile Alliance dwarves have infiltrated our sacred grounds in the Thorn Gorge! Enlist yourself to rid these pests out of the lands of the Earthmother!','Vile Alliance dwarves have infiltrated our sacred grounds in the Thorn Gorge! Enlist yourself to rid these pests out of the lands of the Earthmother!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(8016301,'<Seems like Gryphon\'s got something on his mind...>','<Seems like Gryphon\'s got something on his mind...>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(8016302,'Take me to Balor!','Take me to Balor!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(8045202,'I am here to collect the enchanted horseshoes','I am here to collect the enchanted horseshoes',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(8045203,'Indeed. I have already received word and payment, they are yours to carry back to where they now belong.','Indeed. I have already received word and payment, they are yours to carry back to where they now belong.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0);
